values ('bbbb0004-0000-4000-8000-00000000002c', 'en', null, 'Forensic Science', 'How science turns the physical traces left at an event into evidence a court can weigh - from the crime scene to fingerprints, DNA, and the statistics of interpreting a match. Structure adapted from The Open University''s OpenLearn (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0); all explanations original.', null, 'foundations', 42, true, 'science', '{}')
